# Way Too Much Manual Data Entry

Canonical source: https://webworldmaker.com/problem/operational-inefficiency/
Scope: Machine-readable mirror of claims visible on the canonical human page.

If your staff spends half their day moving names from a spreadsheet into an invoice system, you're essentially burning money. Humans get tired, we make typos, and we're expensive. Robots (well, simple scripts and APIs) don't mind the boring stuff. We automate these repetitive tasks so your team can focus on work that actually matters.